ktiveres i overgangsløsningen via `UseManifestFileShim = true` og legacy-feltene `ExternalServiceCodeLegacy` og `ExternalServiceEditionCodeLegacy`. [2][5]\n\nHvis du mener **høynivåarkitekturen** generelt for Altinn 3 Broker, inkluderer den også komponenter som **ID-porten**, **Maskinporten**, **Altinn Authorization**, **Altinn Notifications**, **Altinn Events**, **Altinn Studio** og **Altinn Billing**. [3]\n\nDet er altså litt **ambiguitet** i spørsmålet:  \n- **“overgangsfasen”** peker mest presist på **Altinn 3 Broker Transition Solution** med Altinn 2 bridge. [1][2][4]  \n- **“tekniske arkitekturen bak Altinn Broker”** kan også tolkes som den bredere **High Level Solution Overview** for Altinn 3 Broker. [3]\n\nHvis du vil, kan jeg også oppsummere dette som et enkelt arkitekturdiagram i tekstform.", :search-errors [], :search-passes 1}, :error nil, :id "altinn-broker-technical-overview", :improved false, :query "Hva er den tekniske arkitekturen bak Altinn Broker i overgangsfasen?", :regressed false, :relaxed {:answer-pass true, :budget-state {:low-read-budget? true, :low-search-budget? false, :max-read-content-length 16000, :max-read-operations 6, :max-search-passes 4, :read-content-budget-exhausted? false, :read-content-length-remaining 1045, :read-content-length-used 14955, :read-operations-exhausted? true, :read-operations-remaining 0, :read-operations-used 6, :search-budget-exhausted? false, :search-passes-remaining 3, :search-passes-used 1}, :durations-ms {:total 59101.031042}, :error nil, :golden-present false, :inspection {:largest-read {:chunk-range {:from 0, :to 4}, :content-length 6526, :doc-num "b6c43b81c669", :mode :doc-range, :operation 1, :returned-chunks [{:chunk-id "3815339142c4", :chunk-index 0, :content-length 417, :doc-num "b6c43b81c669", :title "Technical overview"} {:chunk-id "63e3857a5897"} {:chunk-id "01fdec6b497d"}], :returned-count 5}, :reads [{:chunk-range {:from 0, :to 4}, :content-length 6526, :doc-num "b6c43b81c669", :mode :doc-range,